{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n<your_rewritten_code_4>\nn, m = map(int, input().split())\narr = list(map(int, input().split()))\n\nleft = arr[:n//2]\nright = arr[n//2:]\n\nleft_size = len(left)\nright_size = len(right)\n\nleft_sums = []\nfor i in range(2**left_size):\n    total = 0\n    for j in range(left_size):\n        if i & (1 << j):\n            total += left[j]\n    left_sums.append(total % m)\n\nright_sums = []\nfor i in range(2**right_size):\n    total = 0\n    for j in range(right_size):\n        if i & (1 << j):\n            total += right[j]\n    right_sums.append(total % m)\n\nleft_sums.sort()\nright_sums.sort()\n\nanswer = 0\n\ndef get_largest_less_than(sorted_list, threshold):\n    low, high = 0, len(sorted_list) - 1\n    candidate = 0\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if sorted_list[mid] < threshold:\n            candidate = sorted_list[mid]\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n    return candidate\n\nfor left_val in left_sums:\n    required = m - left_val\n    right_val = get_largest_less_than(right_sums, required)\n    combined = (left_val + right_val) % m\n    if combined > answer:\n        answer = combined\n\nprint(answer)\n</your_rewritten_code_4>\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint get_largest_less_than(vector<int>& sorted_list, int threshold) {\n    int low = 0, high = sorted_list.size() - 1;\n    int candidate = 0;\n    while (low <= high) {\n        int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        if (sorted_list[mid] < threshold) {\n            candidate = sorted_list[mid];\n            low = mid + 1;\n        } else {\n            high = mid - 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return candidate;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int n, m;\n    cin >> n >> m;\n    \n    vector<int> arr(n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        cin >> arr[i];\n    }\n    \n    vector<int> left, right;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n/2; i++) {\n        left.push_back(arr[i]);\n    }\n    for (int i = n/2; i < n; i++) {\n        right.push_back(arr[i]);\n    }\n    \n    int left_size = left.size();\n    int right_size = right.size();\n    \n    vector<int> left_sums;\n    for (int i = 0; i < (1 << left_size); i++) {\n        int total = 0;\n        for (int j = 0; j < left_size; j++) {\n            if (i & (1 << j)) {\n                total += left[j];\n            }\n        }\n        left_sums.push_back(total % m);\n    }\n    \n    vector<int> right_sums;\n    for (int i = 0; i < (1 << right_size); i++) {\n        int total = 0;\n        for (int j = 0; j < right_size; j++) {\n            if (i & (1 << j)) {\n                total += right[j];\n            }\n        }\n        right_sums.push_back(total % m);\n    }\n    \n    sort(left_sums.begin(), left_sums.end());\n    sort(right_sums.begin(), right_sums.end());\n    \n    int answer = 0;\n    \n    for (int left_val : left_sums) {\n        int required = m - left_val;\n        int right_val = get_largest_less_than(right_sums, required);\n        int combined = (left_val + right_val) % m;\n        if (combined > answer) {\n            answer = combined;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    cout << answer << endl;\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00012468514614738524, -2.145764938177308e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00011514954530866817, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.015949550899677e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -2.1219027985353023e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -2.145764938177308e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.3112935448589269e-05, -0.07889051735401154, -0.4741007387638092, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.001515431678853929, -0.05492766574025154, -0.00038580605178140104, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.2636104656849056e-05, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -0.07890836894512177, -0.008614521473646164, -0.002491229446604848, -1.0013530300057027e-05, -5.722029527532868e-06, 0.0, -9.536738616588991e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -5.8412379075889476e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.576272320060525e-06, -0.00021026308240834624, -5.364403477869928e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.5231536030769348, -1.6689286894688848e-06, 0.0, -0.6333213448524475, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -2.622600959512056e-06, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.7046782886609435e-05, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.3112935448589269e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.537788011773955e-05, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -9.536738616588991e-07, 0.0, -8.702239938429557e-06, -1.1920928244